From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 13:41:38 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 052/207] In-model runner core: cell scanner, result holds and
 delivery on the lane host

Closed code cells in a reply start circuit runs at once; the model's own result
header holds the stream until the run settles, then the run's output is forced
in its place (abstain keeps the model's text). Off unless a request sets
run_cells on a host with a runner; host tests use a scripted fake model and a
fake backend.
